# Live tests for the deployed `gateway` edge function.
# Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# IP limiting: unsigned direct requests below now return 403 before routing.
# Use the deployed Next.js adapters for live client tests, e.g.
# GET https://YOUR_APP/api/restrooms?zip=40385
# Only OPTIONS preflights bypass signed IP verification. Project API keys and
# user JWTs do not replace the dedicated server-generated IP assertion.
#
# Values are read from ./.env (gitignored). Add these keys there:
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<project anon/publishable key>
#   TEST_EMAIL=<an existing account email>
#   TEST_PASSWORD=<that account's password>
#
# /places/bathrooms needs no user login but does require a trusted IP assertion.
# Run "Login" before logout; it reuses the token.

@baseUrl = https://fpgjugfmkjznfowbxirs.supabase.co/functions/v1/gateway
@anonKey = {{$dotenv SUPABASE_ANON_KEY}}
@email = {{$dotenv TEST_EMAIL}}
@password = {{$dotenv TEST_PASSWORD}}
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Health check (GET only - the route rejects POST with 405)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}

### Bathrooms by ZIP - public
POST {{baseUrl}}/places/bathrooms
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zip": "40385",
  "radius": "1500"
}

### Bathrooms by coordinates - public
POST {{baseUrl}}/places/bathrooms
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": "50.7506",
  "lon": "-73.9972",
  "radius": "1500"
}

### Account access state
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/access
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Login (returns a gateway JWT in `token`)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/login
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Expect 404 - legacy weather route is no longer exposed
POST {{baseUrl}}/weather/dashboard
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Logout (revokes the token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
